{"id":"tozhe","lemma":"тоже","pos":"adv","rank":78,"glosses":["also, too, as well, likewise","either, neither, nor"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5f/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Том тоже там будет?","en":"Will Tom also be there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283483","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"}]},{"text":"Это тоже ваше?","en":"Is this also yours?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"}]},{"text":"Я тебя тоже слышал.","en":"I heard you, too.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270161","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"}]},{"text":"Я тоже хочу помочь.","en":"I want to help, too.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274758","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Я тоже хотел пойти.","en":"I wanted to go, too.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/668877","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"}]}]}